# BC250 category: experimental
# Ollama model: exp-qwen38-27b-ista-gsq-rco-iq3-s
# Acquisition/capability metadata: models/model-catalog.json
# License: Apache-2.0
# Role: quality-first dense 27B main-model experiment for BC-250.
# Approx source GGUF size: 11.8 GB; ISTA describes IQ3_S as the recommended/task-lossless quant.
# Use think=true for the intended reasoning/main-model comparison.
# Text-only first pass: no vision projector and no MTP payload.
# 8K context is deliberate on the 16 GiB UMA profile; expand only after measured headroom.

FROM __BC250_SOURCE__

PARAMETER num_gpu 99
PARAMETER num_keep 256
PARAMETER num_ctx 8192
PARAMETER num_predict 3072

# Qwen3.8 thinking-mode sampling recommendations supported by Ollama Modelfile.
PARAMETER temperature 1.0
PARAMETER top_p 0.95
PARAMETER top_k 20
PARAMETER min_p 0.0
PARAMETER repeat_penalty 1.0
PARAMETER repeat_last_n 64

SYSTEM """You are an experimental high-quality reasoning assistant for office, analytical, technical, and coding work. Follow every user constraint exactly. Preserve important numbers, dates, qualifications, exceptions, and requested output structure. Distinguish supported facts from inference and say when evidence is insufficient. Respond in the requested language or the language of the latest request."""
